D37. A knockout. ~ WOW
D40. These fellows went to France and fought for something or other (abbr.). ~ AEF
D42. Something robbers do for a living. ~ ROB
D45. Yale. ~ ELI
D47. This called the kettle black. ~ POT
D49. The end of a good flivver. ~ RUST
